<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian forex demand falls at auction.</title>
<headline>Nigerian forex demand falls at auction.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's central bank said on Friday it sold $39.71 million in foreign exchange at a rate of 80 naira to the dollar at its latest weekly auction.</p>
<p>Last week it sold $41.25 million at the same rate.</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
